    <p>{"Speed and stability are foundational. Hosting near your audience or using a quality CDN improves TTFB and LCP, which impacts both UX and conversion. Enable compression and caching, minify CSS/JS, and serve images as WebP with explicit dimensions and lazy-loading. Test Core Web Vitals on your key service templates. Add essential structured data such as Organization and LocalBusiness if you serve a city. Early 500s/404s during crawl sessions can dampen trust, so set up error monitoring. A fast, reliable foundation lets your initial content perform instead of being dragged down by technical debt."}</p>
