    <p>{"Turn research into a scalable IA. Each core service gets a top-level page, with child pages for verticals or cities where justified. Create topical clusters to support each service, and link naturally from posts to conversion pages. For a new site, avoid spreading thin across very similar terms; consolidate intent until you build authority. If you target multiple markets, watch for dialect and spelling differences: “delivery” vs “shipping,” “fees” vs “charges.” After launch, use emerging queries in Search Console to refine topics, expand FAQs, and prioritize new long-tail pages."}</p>
