    <p>{"For on‑page, craft concise titles that lead with the primary value and query. Write meta descriptions that earn clicks without overpromising. Use one clear H1, logical subheadings, and compressed images with meaningful alt text in Arabic and English where relevant. Add the right Schema: Organization sitewide, LocalBusiness per location, Product/Service when applicable, and FAQPage where eligible. Link internally from posts to service pages using natural anchors. If bilingual, implement hreflang ar‑eg and en‑eg, and maintain content parity to avoid mixed signals."}</p>
